0:02:59.36,0:03:02.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami. I don't see Sanji or Cedar.Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.73,0:03:07.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me they were taken away...Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.90,0:03:10.61,Main,,0,0,0,,No, he went willingly.Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.61,0:03:11.17,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.17,0:03:13.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Wanda! Carrot!Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.28,0:03:21.21,Main,,0,0,0,,They-gara want you to forget about it. You must understand.Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.21,0:03:23.82,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll take care of Pekoms too.Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.82,0:03:27.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't give the daytime people unnecessary anxiety.Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.18,0:03:30.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Master.Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.64,0:03:35.41,Main,,0,0,0,,You-gara guys showed concern for our broken-hearted citizens.Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.41,0:03:37.33,Main,,0,0,0,,We should thank you.Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.34,0:03:43.64,Main,,0,0,0,,There's silver vine!Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.54,0:03:58.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Master Nekomamushi gets lonely easilyDialogue: 0,0:03:58.52,0:04:07.92,Main,,0,0,0,,When I think of him like that it makes my heart twingeDialogue: 0,0:04:07.92,0:04:16.43,Main,,0,0,0,,When he is bathed in the moonlight his face looks innocentDialogue: 0,0:04:16.93,0:04:26.36,Main,,0,0,0,,He gazes up at it with his sparkling eyesDialogue: 0,0:04:30.76,0:04:39.94,Main,,0,0,0,,But he tries to act tough under the sunDialogue: 0,0:04:39.94,0:04:48.80,Main,,0,0,0,,He does his best and lives his life on his ownDialogue: 0,0:04:49.94,0:04:51.27,Main,,0,0,0,,I like that song.Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.74,0:04:54.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Is Master Nekomamushi really like that?Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.92,0:04:56.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Not at all.Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.30,0:04:59.87,Main,,0,0,0,,He's not?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.87,0:05:01.61,Main,,0,0,0,,It's just a song inspired by him.Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.24,0:05:08.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, "gotta go see a woman" means...Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.44,0:05:11.79,Main,,0,0,0,,...he's gonna get married?Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.79,0:05:14.76,Main,,0,0,0,,That's not necessarily the case but...Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.76,0:05:18.20,Main,,0,0,0,,...it seemed like he was determined.Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.20,0:05:20.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, maybe he'll return with his wife.Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.92,0:05:22.05,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.05,0:05:24.14,Main,,0,0,0,,In that case, we'll get a new member!Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.14,0:05:25.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy-san.Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.82,0:05:28.18,Main,,0,0,0,,The bride is the Emperor's daughter.Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.18,0:05:31.88,Main,,0,0,0,,That means we'll become Big Mom's subordinates.Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.64,0:05:35.45,Main,,0,0,0,,No!Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.45,0:05:39.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course, Sanji-san doesn't want that either.Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.67,0:05:42.55,Main,,0,0,0,,He refused it firmly right there.Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.86,0:05:45.54,Main,,0,0,0,,But that troubles me.Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.54,0:05:51.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Considering who he is dealing with this time, if he couldn't avoid the marriage,Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.91,0:05:54.73,Main,,0,0,0,,what do you think he would do?Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.73,0:05:57.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, he would...Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.58,0:06:04.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's the kind of guy who'll try not to cause us any trouble...Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.16,0:06:08.98,Main,,0,0,0,,So he'd try to separate himself from us!Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.42,0:06:11.88,Main,,0,0,0,,You mean Sanji will quit this group?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.34,0:06:14.15,Main,,0,0,0,,That's even more unacceptable!Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.48,0:06:21.85,Main,,0,0,0,,When he tossed us out, he could've gotten away too.Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.85,0:06:28.10,Main,,0,0,0,,When he wrote the note, I think he'd already made up his mind to go by himself.Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.66,0:06:33.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Mom's daughter, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.68,0:06:37.16,Main,,0,0,0,,He got a pretty troublesome offer of marriage.Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.16,0:06:43.21,Main,,0,0,0,,And did you say Vinsmoke? I guess that family is the key.Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.21,0:06:46.86,Main,,0,0,0,,It could be Sanji's father or mother or brother...Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.86,0:06:53.07,Main,,0,0,0,,They once lived in the North Blue and then moved to the East Blue and now, they're in the New World.Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.07,0:06:54.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable!Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.62,0:06:55.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Vinsmoke...Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.14,0:06:57.56,Main,,0,0,0,,I think I've heard of them before...Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.84,0:07:06.53,Main,,0,0,0,,We're sorry.Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.53,0:07:10.51,Main,,0,0,0,,I wish we could've stopped him at least until you guys arrived...Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.51,0:07:15.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji wouldn't let you stop him. It's not your fault, guys.Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.95,0:07:20.95,Main,,0,0,0,,But, Robin, what if we never get to see him again?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.95,0:07:22.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Nothing wrong with that.Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.98,0:07:23.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.79,0:07:27.70,Main,,0,0,0,,I mean, if he was leaving for good,Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.70,0:07:31.66,Main,,0,0,0,,he should've said "Thank you for everything."Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.66,0:07:34.80,Main,,0,0,0,,And "I'm sorry for causing so much trouble."Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.80,0:07:37.17,Main,,0,0,0,,No, that's not the point!Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.17,0:07:42.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Think about it. We're on an unstoppable train now.Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.69,0:07:45.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Remember what Caesar said?Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.17,0:07:51.74,Main,,0,0,0,,The biggest customer of SMILEs, the artificial Devil Fruits, is Kaidou.Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.72,0:08:01.31,Main,,0,0,0,,We pissed Doflamingo off by destroying the lab on Punk Hazard,Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.31,0:08:04.95,Main,,0,0,0,,we destroyed the SMILE factory in Dressrosa,Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.95,0:08:07.76,Main,,0,0,0,,and the man who's gonna go nuts next is...Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.30,0:08:11.61,Main,,0,0,0,,...Emperor Kaidou!Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.61,0:08:14.07,Main,,0,0,0,,He's not some distant threat anymore.Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.35,0:08:19.08,Main,,0,0,0,,We've already had a fight with his subordinates, the Beast Pirates.Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.48,0:08:25.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Jack who ruined this country, and others will come after us in a matter of time!Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.80,0:08:31.08,Main,,0,0,0,,We're allying with Tra-guy for upcoming battles.Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.08,0:08:36.41,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know why but it seems like Kin'emon and the others are targeted by Kaidou too.Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.41,0:08:41.43,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll face Emperor Kaidou very soon!Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.43,0:08:47.64,Main,,0,0,0,,How stupid can he be to get involved with another Emperor, Big Mom, now?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.64,0:08:48.67,Main,,0,0,0,,That twirly-eyebrowed fool!Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.66,0:08:53.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't say it like that!Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.42,0:08:59.25,Main,,0,0,0,,You boorish son of a gun! Those things are unrelated!Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.51,0:09:04.89,Main,,0,0,0,,First of all, how could he get wrapped up in such a thing as marriage?! It's such a small deal!Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.22,0:09:07.20,Main,,0,0,0,,What did you say?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.20,0:09:10.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Both of you! Don't get so heated up!Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.39,0:09:12.44,Main,,0,0,0,,It is a big deal!Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.44,0:09:15.74,Main,,0,0,0,,You can't say someone else's problem is big or small!Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.74,0:09:16.33,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.33,0:09:18.07,Main,,0,0,0,,All right!Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.07,0:09:21.51,Main,,0,0,0,,We don't know what's on his mind so let's go ask him!Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.50,0:09:23.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.07,0:09:24.72,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.28,0:09:28.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Forget it, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.55,0:09:31.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me we're gonna head for Big Mom!Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.01,0:09:32.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I guess so.Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.75,0:09:36.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you forget that you picked a fight with her?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.35,0:09:41.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Without a strategy or reinforcements, we'll just get beaten and that'll be it!Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.52,0:09:43.59,Main,,0,0,0,,She's an Emperor.Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.59,0:09:47.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Don't forget. She's on a totally different level than any of our past enemies.Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.64,0:09:49.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, we'll go quietly.Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.40,0:09:51.54,Main,,0,0,0,,How do we find them?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.10,0:09:56.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, there is a way to go after them but...Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.72,0:10:02.78,Main,,0,0,0,,He's right.Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.78,0:10:07.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji-san has gone because of the Big Mom Pirates...Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.85,0:10:11.42,Main,,0,0,0,,But they left something big behind instead.Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.50,0:10:18.46,Main,,0,0,0,,If that person is awake now, there should be something he can tell us.Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.46,0:10:22.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's just keep going.Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.42,0:10:45.62,Main,,0,0,0,,This place has been totally wrecked.Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.33,0:10:54.13,Captions,,30,0,240,,Whale Forest Dwelling of the GuardiansDialogue: 0,0:11:03.24,0:11:09.15,Main,,0,0,0,,The Whale Tree looks even bigger up close!Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.00,0:11:14.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys!Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.25,0:11:16.48,Main,,0,0,0,,It's the Straw Hats!Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.48,0:11:18.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Chopper is here!Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.09,0:11:20.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Garchu!Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.17,0:11:21.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Garchu!Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.83,0:11:24.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Garchu!Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.34,0:11:27.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Garchu!Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.10,0:11:32.52,Main,,0,0,0,,The Minks are recovering fast, aren't they?Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.52,0:11:33.17,Main,,0,0,0,,You're right.Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.46,0:11:35.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.19,0:11:36.37,Main,,0,0,0,,It's us!Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.69,0:11:38.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry for what we did in the forest.Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.83,0:11:42.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter who it is, we can't let any invader get by!Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.45,0:11:44.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you guys!Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.68,0:11:46.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, never mind!Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.64,0:11:50.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Um, where's Nekomamushi?Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.38,0:11:54.42,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to see you!Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.42,0:11:57.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Our saviors and their friends!Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.61,0:12:00.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me say it once again.Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.02,0:12:00.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you!Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.16,0:12:02.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Who is this?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.03,0:12:06.81,Captions,,0,0,335,,Captain of the Whale Forest Guardians (Jaguar Mink) Treetop PedroDialogue: 0,0:12:03.42,0:12:05.95,Main,,0,0,3,,Sorry for my subordinates' action in the forest.Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.95,0:12:08.04,Main,,0,0,3,,They were too wary of invaders.Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.60,0:12:10.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Were you there?Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.88,0:12:13.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, I was up in a tree.Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.60,0:12:16.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Bepo and the others are waiting for you-gara guys back there.Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.70,0:12:21.35,Main,,0,0,0,,We can see them later.Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.65,0:12:24.72,Main,,0,0,0,,We wanna see Master Nekomamushi and Pekomamushi the lion first.Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.65,0:12:26.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Garchu!Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.56,0:12:31.61,Main,,0,0,0,,If you're talking about Pekoms, he's up now. He's in the building at the back.Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.61,0:12:35.45,Main,,0,0,0,,We kept the whole incident secret from everybody.Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.45,0:12:37.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji is a nice guy.Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.55,0:12:39.67,Main,,0,0,0,,I hope we can help you in some way.Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.14,0:12:45.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy! I'm worried about Nakomamushi; not just about his condition,Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.90,0:12:47.46,Main,,0,0,0,,so I'll go see him first!Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.46,0:12:48.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.21,0:12:51.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, let me lead the way, Dr. Chopper.Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.02,0:13:08.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper! Why are you frozen?Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.58,0:13:12.28,Main,,0,0,0,,I-I-I'm not frozen.Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.28,0:13:13.24,Main,,0,0,0,,You're acting strange.Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.32,0:13:16.67,Main,,0,0,0,,It's this way.Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.67,0:13:17.74,Main,,0,0,0,,O-Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.06,0:13:21.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Master Nekomamushi is taking a bath now.Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.48,0:13:27.02,Main,,0,0,0,,A bath?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.47,0:13:28.84,Captions,,0,0,0,,SAKEDialogue: 0,0:13:30.97,0:13:31.07,Captions,,0,0,0,,PROTECTDialogue: 0,0:13:31.07,0:13:31.17,Captions,,0,0,0,,PROTECTDialogue: 0,0:13:31.17,0:13:31.30,Captions,,0,0,0,,PROTECTDialogue: 0,0:13:31.30,0:13:31.44,Captions,,0,0,0,,PROTECTDialogue: 0,0:13:31.44,0:13:31.55,Captions,,0,0,0,,PROTECTDialogue: 0,0:13:31.55,0:13:31.65,Captions,,0,0,0,,PROTECTDialogue: 0,0:13:31.65,0:13:31.77,Captions,,0,0,0,,PROTECTDialogue: 0,0:13:34.02,0:13:36.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Lasagna!Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.91,0:13:40.36,Main,,0,0,0,,It's good-meow! Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.14,0:13:43.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nekomamushi!Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.00,0:13:46.17,Main,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't take a bath! Your wound is gonna reopen!Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.49,0:13:48.44,Main,,0,0,0,,And you should eat light meals!Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.44,0:13:50.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are you using your left hand?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.70,0:13:56.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you listening to me?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.11,0:13:57.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Chopper!Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.69,0:14:01.09,Main,,0,0,0,,No problem. No problem!Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.09,0:14:04.61,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm a freedom-loving man!Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.61,0:14:06.26,Main,,0,0,0,,You have to listen to your doctor!Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.26,0:14:08.79,Main,,0,0,0,,He's larger than I expected.Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.79,0:14:11.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry but even if it's a doctor's instruction...Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.92,0:14:13.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoops...Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.14,0:14:15.13,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't care!Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.46,0:14:19.20,Main,,0,0,0,,I still can't get used to not having a left hand!Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.00,0:14:23.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't even clap my hands like this!Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.08,0:14:30.49,Main,,0,0,0,,So you-gara people are the Straw Hats!Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.49,0:14:32.38,Main,,0,0,0,,You saved me!Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.68,0:14:34.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you!Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.14,0:14:39.36,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll repay my debt to you someday!Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.91,0:14:44.06,Main,,0,0,0,,I may not look it but I have a strong sense of obligation and compassion!Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.58,0:14:49.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, a ball.Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.17,0:14:57.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah! A ball!Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.26,0:15:04.05,Main,,0,0,0,,I told you to rest!Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.02,0:15:09.99,Main,,0,0,0,,See! The wound reopened!Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.32,0:15:18.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen, I...Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.86,0:15:22.77,Main,,0,0,0,,I got into bed because I wanted to.Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.77,0:15:25.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh, uh-huh, okay.Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.64,0:15:27.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Whatever the case, just stay still!Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.99,0:15:29.67,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna give you a shot.Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.60,0:15:32.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, you-gara!Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.68,0:15:36.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Show me that foxtail right there.Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.32,0:15:39.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Like this?Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.00,0:15:48.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Chopper! Hurry up while I'm distracted and enjoying myself!Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.63,0:15:50.06,Main,,0,0,0,,I told you to stay still!Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.43,0:15:53.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you afraid of shots?! Even looking like that?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.78,0:16:04.74,Main,,0,0,0,,It's completely cured now.Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.74,0:16:08.01,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no wonder drug like that so keep quiet!Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.01,0:16:09.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't hit an injured person.Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.72,0:16:14.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Boy, he's so funny!Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.82,0:16:16.65,Main,,0,0,0,,I love him!Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.15,0:16:20.56,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you survived!Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.85,0:16:25.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I blocked about half of the attack with my ability! Grr!Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.60,0:16:27.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Bege, that bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.77,0:16:33.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. They must've taken Black-Leg with them.Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.08,0:16:35.81,Main,,0,0,0,,He can't get away from the wedding now!Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.18,0:16:38.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, about that, Pekomamushi...Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.93,0:16:41.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Who arranged the marriage?Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.52,0:16:48.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, of course, our Mama and the father of the Vinsmoke Family!Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.09,0:16:50.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji-kun's father?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.35,0:16:52.59,Main,,0,0,0,,What kind of person is he?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.59,0:16:56.56,Main,,0,0,0,,He's quite infamous in the underworld.Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.96,0:17:01.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Have you ever heard the name, Germa 66?Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.19,0:17:03.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Also known as the Warmongers.Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.43,0:17:04.93,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.93,0:17:07.87,Main,,0,0,0,,That's a mythical evil army!Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.16,0:17:10.11,Main,,0,0,0,,How ridiculous!Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.82,0:17:15.15,Main,,0,0,0,,No, it's an actual organization.Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.15,0:17:19.05,Main,,0,0,0,,The Vinsmoke Family is at the top of it!Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.05,0:17:23.54,Main,,0,0,0,,And their boss is Black-Leg's father!Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.80,0:17:27.06,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Believe this if nothing else.Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.63,0:17:31.48,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to hide anything from my friends.Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.28,0:17:40.47,Main,,0,0,0,,The Vinsmoke Family is, well, to put it simply...Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.38,0:17:44.61,Main,,0,0,0,,A family of assassins!Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.18,0:17:54.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji-kun is from a family of assassins?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.96,0:17:59.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're talking about and I don't care!Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.06,0:18:03.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Grr! I'm sure you don't!Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.84,0:18:08.16,Main,,0,0,0,,What we wanna know is whether he'll come back or not!Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.16,0:18:10.00,Main,,0,0,0,,He can get married if he wants!Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.60,0:18:16.80,Main,,0,0,0,,But we don't wanna become Big Mom's subordinates because of it!Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.80,0:18:19.74,Main,,0,0,0,,So if they get married, you guys become my subordinates!Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.88,0:18:26.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Ouch!Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.40,0:18:36.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Pekoms, are you okay?Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.19,0:18:38.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy, you're funny!Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.73,0:18:42.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Watch what you say, you brat! Or I'll destroy you!Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.58,0:18:44.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Grr!Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.44,0:18:47.34,Main,,0,0,0,,I owe you guys but don't push your luck!Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.34,0:18:51.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama is one of the Four Emperors of the sea!Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.48,0:18:51.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.06,0:18:55.31,Main,,0,0,0,,This is bad for my wound.Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.71,0:18:57.78,Main,,0,0,0,,You have pretty eyes.Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.14,0:19:01.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up!Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.12,0:19:09.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, either way, he can't escape the marriage.Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.89,0:19:11.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Why?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.17,0:19:14.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Just like Black-Leg has gone to attend it,Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.86,0:19:21.11,Main,,0,0,0,,no one can turn down an invitation to Mama's tea party on any account.Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.11,0:19:29.05,Main,,0,0,0,,If anybody turns it down, they'll get themselves quite a shocking present.Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.05,0:19:32.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Because they put Mama to shame.Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.52,0:19:36.85,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not the kind of present you want.Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.66,0:19:43.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Inside they would receive the decapitated head of a person who was close to them!Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.94,0:19:51.33,Main,,0,0,0,,It could be a head of someone from the Straw Hats...Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.33,0:19:56.14,Main,,0,0,0,,...or someone from the restaurant in the East Blue.Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.20,0:20:02.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, it could be someone from the Kamabakka Kingdom.Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.40,0:20:06.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! How do you guys know about all those things?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.54,0:20:14.26,Main,,0,0,0,,That's what power can do, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.06,0:20:18.76,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,What he was told at that time must have been...Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.46,0:20:26.60,Main,,0,0,0,,When someone as powerful as that makes a threat, it's definitely not idle.Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.66,0:20:30.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Who can fight it?Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.56,0:20:34.78,Main,,0,0,0,,That's how powerful the Four Emperors are!Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.78,0:20:38.95,Main,,0,0,0,,There's really nothing you can do about it!Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.18,0:20:43.69,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why Sanji-kun had no choice but to go!Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.92,0:20:51.52,Main,,0,0,0,,There's one other thing. Let me ease your worry, my saviors.Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.52,0:20:55.53,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys will not become her subordinates. Grr!Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.96,0:21:00.60,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a political marriage.Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.91,0:21:06.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama always forms a connection with those who'll become her subordinates.Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.27,0:21:08.35,Main,,0,0,0,,So this marriage is a ritualDialogue: 0,0:21:08.35,0:21:13.80,Main,,0,0,0,,to form a connection between the Vinsmoke Family and the Charlotte Family.Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.80,0:21:17.15,Main,,0,0,0,,It's got nothing to do with you guys.Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.06,0:21:21.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to break it down for you more?Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.80,0:21:25.77,Main,,0,0,0,,From the moment they get married,Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.77,0:21:30.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Black-Leg Sanji will no longer be part of your crew!Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.82,0:21:32.59,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.59,0:21:35.41,Main,,0,0,0,,That's totally unacceptable! Sanji's my friend!Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.52,0:21:40.68,Main,,0,0,0,,But he's Vinsmoke's son first!Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.68,0:21:42.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't get mad at me! Grr!Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.16,0:21:49.57,Main,,0,0,0,,I know Sanji will refuse such a marriage!Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.57,0:21:54.07,Main,,0,0,0,,In the face of Mama and the vicious Vinsmoke Family?Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.07,0:21:58.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I wonder if he can manage to stay alive after he refuses.Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.38,0:21:59.80,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.80,0:22:03.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Pekomamushi! What are you gonna do now?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.48,0:22:08.22,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll go back to Mama after I get well.Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.22,0:22:12.28,Main,,0,0,0,,That bastard Bege thinks he killed me!Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.28,0:22:15.11,Main,,0,0,0,,But he can't get away with it!Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.11,0:22:17.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, take me with you!Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.10,0:22:19.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.21,0:22:21.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami, I'm gonna go by myself.Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.32,0:22:22.15,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.15,0:22:27.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Like Robin and the others said, if we go together, it'd seem like we want a war.Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.99,0:22:30.39,Main,,0,0,0,,We don't have time for that.Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.90,0:22:33.91,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll go by myself!Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.91,0:22:39.22,Main,,0,0,0,,If I go with him, maybe I can sneak into the tea party and ruin the wedding.Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.22,0:22:43.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Screw you! Are you asking me to harbor an enemy?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.04,0:22:44.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, sounds like fun!Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.52,0:22:48.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Carrot, this is serious!Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.85,0:22:50.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, it's a deal!Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.59,0:22:52.52,Main,,0,0,0,,H-Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.60,0:22:54.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Ouch!Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.22,0:22:56.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll get Chopper! Get well already!Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.62,0:23:01.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't just decide that!Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.59,0:23:04.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow... Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.24,0:23:07.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.58,0:23:11.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Zoro, you're here! Did you hear all that?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.13,0:23:12.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Just barely.Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.49,0:23:15.14,Main,,0,0,0,,You're worried about Sanji, aren't you?Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.84,0:23:19.76,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll kick you, fool! I told you to forget about that idiot!Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.76,0:23:21.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.59,0:23:25.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Zoro! How's Pekoms doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.78,0:23:27.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Chopper!Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.54,0:23:31.59,Main,,0,0,0,,He's crying from pain and banging his head against a wall and yelling!Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.59,0:23:32.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Cure him now!Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.66,0:23:36.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Those are crazy symptoms! I'll check him right away!Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.72,0:23:41.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Garchu! Baron Corpe!Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.26,0:23:52.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh! You-gara are Straw Hat Luffy, aren't you?! I couldn't wait to meet you!Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.54,0:23:55.98,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Why did you follow us?! Get rest!Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.98,0:23:58.48,Main,,0,0,0,,I just got better!Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.48,0:23:59.82,Main,,0,0,0,,No, you didn't!Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.09,0:24:04.05,Main,,0,0,0,,He's huge! Is that Nekomamushi?! He's a cat monster!Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.65,0:24:13.90,Main,,0,0,0,,A Garchu of thanks!Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.35,0:24:31.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Nekomamushi is spouting blood!Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.75,0:24:34.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing, cat monster!?Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.54,0:24:42.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Stay with me! Nekomamushi!Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.78,0:24:48.57,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on?Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.57,0:24:51.30,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm out of blood! Bring me some blood quick!Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.70,0:24:53.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, Dr. Chopper.Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.16,0:24:56.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Th-Th-Th-Thank...Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.67,0:24:58.38,Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Chopper?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.38,0:25:00.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Cat monster, stand up! I'll cut you up!Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.27,0:25:03.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa-whoa, he's injured.Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.84,0:25:05.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Tra-guy!Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.64,0:25:07.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh! Are they your friends?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.09,0:25:12.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I came to introduce them to you. They're my crew; 20 in total!Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.49,0:25:17.26,Main,,0,0,4,,It's nice to make your acquaintance! Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.74,0:25:17.26,Captions,,0,0,170,,Heart PiratesDialogue: 0,0:25:17.26,0:25:18.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.39,0:25:19.90,Main,,0,0,0,,We need to talk.Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.40,0:25:21.53,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Is that it?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.76,0:25:24.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Heartless! Heartless!Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.43,0:25:28.91,Secondary,,0,0,0,,Heartless! Heartless! Heartless! Heartless! Heartless!Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.80,0:25:28.91,Main,,0,0,0,,We feel slighted, Captain!Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.91,0:25:33.41,Main,,0,0,0,,We're just allies. We don't necessarily have to get friendly.Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.17,0:25:39.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Help me...Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.86,0:25:43.22,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Black-Foot-ya went to Big Mom?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.22,0:25:44.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.83,0:25:47.10,Main,,0,0,0,,How in the world could that happen?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.10,0:25:50.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry! I'm gonna go take him back!Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.33,0:25:53.63,Main,,0,0,0,,So could you wait to fight Kaidou a little bit?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.96,0:25:55.80,Main,,0,0,0,,That's not my call!Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.80,0:25:59.00,Main,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time before Kaidou comes after us!Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.12,0:26:05.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought we could hide ourselves here in Zou for a while but they know where it is.Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.74,0:26:14.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if their target is us next, what do you think will happen to this country if it's attacked again?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.97,0:26:17.26,Main,,0,0,0,,How kind of you!Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.62,0:26:23.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Since when were they there?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.73,0:26:25.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Garchu!Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.45,0:26:28.10,Main,,0,0,0,,You-gara guys, are you really pirates?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.43,0:26:31.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you for caring about us on top of saving us!Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.97,0:26:33.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you! Garchu!Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.01,0:26:37.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Pekoms, are you hurt?Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.95,0:26:39.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah...Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.05,0:26:40.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, who cares!Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.88,0:26:43.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's have a banquet!Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.64,0:26:45.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Bring drinks and food!Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.28,0:26:47.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Why, Nekomamushi?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.32,0:26:48.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm in!Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.92,0:26:50.05,Main,,0,0,0,,No you're not!Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.05,0:27:35.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Seems like Luffy-san and the others are completely forgetting about it.Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.80,0:27:41.58,Main,,0,0,0,,But we mature adults must get our act together.Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.58,0:27:44.54,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right. This country doesn't want them.Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.54,0:27:48.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Under no circumstances should a samurai enter!Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.16,0:27:51.89,Main,,0,0,0,,After all, Raizo-san, the person Kin'emon-san andDialogue: 0,0:27:51.89,0:27:55.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Kanjurou-san are looking for, isn't here so there's no point to enter.Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.77,0:27:58.66,Main,,0,0,0,,In addition, because of that,Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.78,0:28:03.29,Main,,0,0,0,,the millennium-old city was ruined!Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.76,0:28:07.90,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Bring Raizo here!Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.02,0:28:12.00,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Where's the warrior from the Land of Wano?Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.10,0:28:18.52,Main,,0,0,0,,They call us saviors and thank us.Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.52,0:28:24.35,Main,,0,0,0,,So we absolutely can't tell them that we actually have some samurai friends.Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.54,0:28:35.36,Main,,0,0,0,,If they find out that Kin'emon and the others were going to use this island as their rendezvous point...Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.36,0:28:39.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Even the cheerful Minks would be pissed off.Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.54,0:28:52.44,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna fight them after we got to know each other!Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.44,0:28:57.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's keep guard all night long to prevent Kin'emon and Kanjurou from entering.Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.63,0:29:09.36,Captions,,0,0,170,,The next morningDialogue: 0,0:29:14.66,0:29:19.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Well... Well, well, well, it's still dark so it's before dawn.Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.93,0:29:21.89,Main,,0,0,0,,We made it!Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.89,0:29:25.04,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right! We finally made it!Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.62,0:29:32.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh boy, it was a disaster, but all's well that ends well.Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.36,0:29:45.97,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Luffy-dono and everybody are worried about us.Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.97,0:29:47.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I feel bad.Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.60,0:29:50.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, they must've been waiting for us!Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.75,0:29:53.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Well done, Torasaburo.Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.64,0:29:57.77,Note,,0,0,0,,Note: tora = tigerDialogue: 0,0:29:53.37,0:29:57.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Tora-?! Oh, I didn't know this animal was a tiger!Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.07,0:30:00.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright, that's enough. Revert to a painting!Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.56,0:30:09.37,Main,,0,0,0,,But monkey fellow, you didn't tell us anything after all.Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.37,0:30:11.39,Main,,0,0,0,,I just wanna know if a warrior named Raizo is...Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.10,0:30:15.85,Main,,0,0,0,,I-I don't know anything-saru!Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.85,0:30:18.80,Main,,0,0,0,,What's the matter? You look pale...Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.32,0:30:22.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, wait! Where are you going?!Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.90,0:30:25.49,Main,,0,0,0,,We can't look for Raizo on our own!Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.49,0:30:28.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait, monkey fellow! We need you to take us around!Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.21,0:30:36.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh no-saru! Samurai are here-saru!Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.84,0:30:38.78,Main,,0,0,0,,I gotta let them know as soon as possible!Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.28,0:30:43.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Samurai are here-saru!Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.65,0:30:46.70,OP11 Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing: Galaxy 9000  Timing: Datenshi, Sewil  QC: Mr Luffy, Galaxy 9000, Datenshi Grug  Soundtracking: Halee  TC/Infoboxes: Datenshi  Translation: Yibis